Automatic Differentiation
=======================

Forward Mode
-----------
Forward-mode automatic differentiation computes derivatives alongside function evaluation using the chain rule.

Basic Rules
----------
.. math::

   \frac{d}{dx}[f(x) + g(x)] &= f'(x) + g'(x)
   
   \frac{d}{dx}[f(x)g(x)] &= f'(x)g(x) + f(x)g'(x)

Implementation
-------------
.. code-block:: python

   def f(x):  # f(x) = x^2 * sin(x)
       return x * x * x.sin()
       
   x = Dual(2.0, 1.0)  # Evaluate at x=2
   result = f(x)
   print(f"f'(2) = {result.dual}")

